      "readingOrder": 6,
      "title": "Why we built this site",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why we built this site"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "This overview is for you, the owner of Quality Heating & Air. It describes the draft a customer in Lebanon would use."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What a customer can do"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Someone whose air conditioner will not cool, or whose heat will not come on, sees that problem first. The next step is a call to "
            },
            {
              "text": "(417) 532-6239",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " or a work request. The request opens in Jobber, off this website, and it does not confirm an appointment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The homepage names the shop at 22124 Highway 32 and offers AC repair or heating repair. Weekday hours are 8am–4:30pm. Saturday and Sunday are by appointment only. Emergency service uses the line already on your site: contact us at your convenience."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "How the pages are split"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The homepage carries HVAC contractor in Lebanon and sends the customer to the page that matches the problem. AC repair is the cooling visit. Heating repair stays on the heating unit in the home or the business, the same breadth as your current site."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Repair, a maintenance check, and a consultation on system options all stay available, because your site offers each of them. The copy leaves the choice with the customer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Contact is the short list: phone, email, the Jobber work request, the Highway 32 address, and hours. WhatsApp stays at (417) 288-2968 so it is not mistaken for the shop phone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Questions for you"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Emergency service is offered, and weekends are by appointment only. There is no after-hours schedule on the site. How should those two facts read together?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Should WhatsApp stay on the contact page at (417) 288-2968?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Your site does not name towns beyond Lebanon. Is Lebanon the service area you want shown?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "The shop links to general Lennox and Amana product pages. Lennox's dealer locator matches this address and phone. Premier Dealer wording on that locator is not used as your badge. Do you want any manufacturer link on the customer pages?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "The current homepage says Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed and does not define a remedy. This draft leaves that heading off. What should it mean if you want it back?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Financing is only the application link. Should that link stay, with no rates on the page?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Your live site also has a message form. This draft does not add a second form. Phone, email, and the Jobber request are the paths. Do you want that message form represented?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "No review quotations appear, because the exact review words are not in the evidence this draft can quote. When those words are available, which comments should sit next to the work?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "route": "/"
